From: Aurora contributors <noreply@aurora-silicon.org>
Subject: [PROPOSAL] sandbox: admit topology-linked Request API decoder nodes

MPL-2.0. Independently implemented from the public behavior described in
Mozilla bug 2080696, reported by Christian Bartels. This version bounds
and verifies both topology queries and permits four exact media ioctls.
It has not been compiled as Firefox or hardware-qualified.

